that were a lot less detailed.

00:07:27.786 --> 00:07:30.003
(upbeat music)

00:07:30.003 --> 00:07:31.020
(buzzer buzzes)

00:07:31.020 --> 00:07:31.980
- Oh.

00:07:31.980 --> 00:07:33.390
Damn.

